# A09 result

`PASS_METHOD_SCOPED`: the actual opt-in V15 release-batch backend admitted `a` (X keycode 38); an independent X11 client observed KeyPress and keymap-down, then after session-only SIGKILL observed KeyRelease and keymap-up. The identity-matched `rpc_eof` receipt was fsynced and reports verified recovery, an empty verified close release, and a stopped owner thread. The owner service exited 0 without forced termination. The supervisor requested Xvfb termination and observed clean exit code 0.

This result is limited to one WSL2/Xvfb run of the actual backend constructor/raw-key path. It does not establish full V15 CLI or outer V39 integration, desktop automation, physical-device behavior, task completion, or general product-level computer control. No game or model ran.
